  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 出品模组。用心制作，Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 平台的众多活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>精准收集（Silkier Touch）扩展了精准采集附魔的功能。每个特性均可在配置中开启或关闭。你将能够采集包括刷怪笼、龙蛋、未被吃过的蛋糕、被虫蚀的石头等在内的物品！<br><br>完整特性列表请见下方配置设置。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>查看详情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>enableDragonEggDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>禁用龙蛋在使用精准采集镐时的传送功能。<br><br><span><strong>enableSpawnerDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>允许刷怪笼在精准采集下掉落，并保留其生物数据。<br><br><span><strong>enableTrialSpawnerDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false<br>降低试炼刷怪笼的“强度”以允许破坏，需使用精准采集镐采集掉落。修改此选项需重启游戏。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>enableFullCakeDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>允许未被吃过的蛋糕在精准采集下掉落，带蜡烛的蛋糕同样适用。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>enableBuddedAmethystDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>允许紫水晶簇在精准采集下掉落。<br><br><span><strong>enableFarmlandDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>允许耕地被精准采集工具采集并掉落。<br><br><span><strong>enableTallGrassDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>允许高草丛被精准采集工具采集并掉落。<br><br><span><strong>enableSnowLayerDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>允许雪层被精准采集工具采集并掉落。<br><br><span><strong>enableVinesDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>允许藤蔓被精准采集工具采集并掉落。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>enableInfestedStoneDrop</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false<br>允许被虫蚀的石头在精准采集下掉落。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>所有使用精准采集附魔采集的物品：<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>刷怪笼：</strong><br><em>试炼刷怪笼默认禁用：</em></span></p>\n<details><summary>查看详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silkier-touch/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong>蛋糕（带或不带蜡烛）以及雪层：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>查看详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silkier-touch/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong>龙蛋不会传送：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>查看详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silkier-touch/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以在任意整合包中自由使用本模组，但下载必须保持在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统内。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事宜，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
